  "body": "\n\nThanks for sending an issue! Please fill in the following template to help quickly solve your problem.\n\n### Describe the current behavior / 问题描述 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \nconv2dv2算子fuzz用例批跑出现optgroup场景的精度问题，NCHW和NHWC场景皆会复现。\n算子规格参考如下：\n算子类型 Conv2D, 数据类型float16\nfmap（NCHW）：[1, 192, 165,18703]\nweight（NCHW）：[32, 192, 1, 1]\ngroup属性：6\nstride/dilation属性：全为1\npad属性：全为0\n\n### Environment / 环境信息 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \nSOC：Ascend950PR\n版本：基于当前最新版本\n### Steps to reproduce the issue / 重现步骤 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \nascend950环境下复跑问题fuzz用例（32核）必现。\n### Describe the expected behavior / 预期结果 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \n单算子执行精度通过，得到输出数据\n### Related log / screenshot / 日志 / 截图 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \n精度比对结果:前1块的比对结果50.024,原因:精度错误\n### Special notes for this issue/备注 (Optional / 选填)\n            \n\n",
